    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unchained: Tale of Enra is a tactical RPG where victory doesn\u2019t always mean violence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a richly woven narrative where your greatest weapon isn't just your blade but your ability to build trust and forge powerful bonds. In <i>Unchained</i>, every decision matters, and your relationships shape not just the story but your success on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to <strong>fight, negotiate,</strong> or <strong>recruit</strong>, the fate of your journey is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Your Enemies</strong><br>Negotiate with foes and bring them onto your team, unlocking unique abilities and expanding your tactical options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust Driven Combat System</strong><br>Build bonds with your party to activate special abilities using the Link Point system. Trust becomes a true combat resource.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Your choices shape both combat outcomes and story arcs, offering a mix of diplomacy, strategy, and action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Strategy</strong><br>Designed with both newcomers and veterans in mind, <i>Unchained</i> delivers deep tactical gameplay with an intuitive streamlined interface.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a narrative where every relationship and every choice leaves a lasting impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path in a world where compassion and combat stand side by side and discover what kind of hero you truly are.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723210/extras/301debc6f5128d8e3f2c6f76fe15526a.avif?t=1747122465\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723210/extras/ff76dca83ac63e4aacf5f551748f0f6d.avif?t=1747122465\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723210/extras/7679c85b60da613ccd5b03c6a526f436.avif?t=1747122465\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723210/extras/6020e1544667c04252265c48793c7310.avif?t=1747122465\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723210/extras/850d2bf157e2e5ea8473f36da31f5f2f.avif?t=1747122465\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
